@startuml UniBridge_SequenzaIngestion
title Sequenza caricamento documenti con approvazione
actor "Responsabile ufficio" as O
participant "API" as API
participant "IngestionService" as I
participant "Parser + Chunker" as P
database "SQLite" as DB
participant "Embedder E5" as E
database "Qdrant" as Q
O -> API : POST /v1/documents
API -> I : ingest(doc, principal)
I -> I : can_manage(office)? altrimenti 403
I -> P : parse + divisione in chunk
P --> I : passaggi con id stabili
I -> DB : documento pending, passaggi indexed=0
API --> O : 202 pending
note over DB, Q : Non ancora ricercabile
O -> API : POST /v1/documents/{id}/approve
API -> I : approve(id)
I -> E : embed_passages("passage: " + testo)
I -> Q : upsert dei vettori (384 dim, coseno)
I -> Q : cancella la versione superata
I -> DB : indice FTS5, indexed=1, approval_log
API --> O : 200 approved
@enduml
